### Role-Based Access & Ownership Logic
ListoYA supports two primary account types with different capabilities and interface behavior:

#### Persona

Persona users can:

 - Create social posts
 - Offer services
 - Create tareas
 - Manage their own profiles and published content

#### Empresa

Empresa users can:

 - Publish job opportunities
 - Offer services
 - Create anuncios
 - Manage company profiles and published content

The frontend uses account type, authentication state, and content ownership to determine which actions and interfaces should be available to each user.

```
Authenticated User
        +
Account Type
        +
Content Type
        +
Content Owner
        ↓
Permission / Ownership Check
        ↓
Available UI Actions
```
